    "detailed_description": "<strong>Disease Z is a survival game in a Post-Apocalyptic world</strong>, which takes place 6 years after a supposed <i>&quot;flu&quot;</i> spread across the continent transforming almost all humans and animals in <strong>zombies</strong>.<br><strong>City Z</strong> was the most affected, as it is a huge and central city on the continent, most cases of <i>&quot;flu&quot;</i> went to hospitals in the city.<br><br><br>Explore the open world of <strong>Disease Z</strong> solo, collecting materials, building base, hunting and fighting to survive. Be careful with nature as it has taken over the city and <i>be even more careful with the sunset.</i><br><br><u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Climate System</h2></u><br><i>Weather system, with rain, cloudy, snow and even sunny day and day and night. Beware of nightfall, enemies get stronger and in places you least expect.</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309350/extras/weather_AdobeExpress_AdobeExpress.gif?t=1698204583\" /></span><br>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Construction</h2></u><br><i>Building mode, it's the best way to escape the weather and hide in the middle of the night.</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309350/extras/test_AdobeExpress_AdobeExpress.gif?t=1698204583\" /></span><br>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunting</h2></u><br><i>Without food you will end up dying easily, a roast beef is a great remedy for an empty stomach</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309350/extras/4eb88b5200141079e83fcdac5c6f7035.poster.avif?t=1698204583\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309350/extras/4eb88b5200141079e83fcdac5c6f7035.webm?t=1698204583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309350/extras/4eb88b5200141079e83fcdac5c6f7035.mp4?t=1698204583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harvest</h2></u><br><i>Your life is based on hunger and thirst, without food you will die, without water you will also die. But like everything in life, everything that is good lasts little, this is a limited resource.</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309350/extras/dba7568a57f682c218fb2a355229e945.poster.avif?t=1698204583\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309350/extras/dba7568a57f682c218fb2a355229e945.webm?t=1698204583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309350/extras/dba7568a57f682c218fb2a355229e945.mp4?t=1698204583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore an open world</h2></u><br><i>A 10 km\u00b2 map, with forests, mountains, cities and much more.</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309350/extras/walking_AdobeExpress_AdobeExpress.gif?t=1698204583\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explorable Locations</li></ul><i>There are places where the items are great, but at a price for it, Hospitals for example can be a great place to get Medkit, but always remember there is a price.</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309350/extras/848de63f0661f2bd864e2bf6a978f998.poster.avif?t=1698204583\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309350/extras/848de63f0661f2bd864e2bf6a978f998.webm?t=1698204583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309350/extras/848de63f0661f2bd864e2bf6a978f998.mp4?t=1698204583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Disease Z is a survival game in a Post-Apocalyptic world</strong>, which takes place 6 years after a supposed <i>&quot;flu&quot;</i> spread across the continent transforming almost all humans and animals in <strong>zombies</strong>.<br><strong>City Z</strong> was the most affected, as it is a huge and central city on the continent, most cases of <i>&quot;flu&quot;</i> went to hospitals in the city.<br><br><br>Explore the open world of <strong>Disease Z</strong> solo, collecting materials, building base, hunting and fighting to survive. Be careful with nature as it has taken over the city and <i>be even more careful with the sunset.</i><br><br><u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Climate System</h2></u><br><i>Weather system, with rain, cloudy, snow and even sunny day and day and night. Beware of nightfall, enemies get stronger and in places you least expect.</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309350/extras/weather_AdobeExpress_AdobeExpress.gif?t=1698204583\" /></span><br>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Construction</h2></u><br><i>Building mode, it's the best way to escape the weather and hide in the middle of the night.</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309350/extras/test_AdobeExpress_AdobeExpress.gif?t=1698204583\" /></span><br>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunting</h2></u><br><i>Without food you will end up dying easily, a roast beef is a great remedy for an empty stomach</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309350/extras/4eb88b5200141079e