always remember there is a price.</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309350/extras/848de63f0661f2bd864e2bf6a978f998.poster.avif?t=1698204583\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309350/extras/848de63f0661f2bd864e2bf6a978f998.webm?t=1698204583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309350/extras/848de63f0661f2bd864e2bf6a978f998.mp4?t=1698204583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
